# Build-context hygiene for the habenula-engine image.
# The context is the TREE ROOT (the tree-root compose.yaml passes `.`), so
# every nested pattern needs the **/ prefix. **/.env and **/.dev.vars are load-bearing:
# they keep the operator's real CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY (the env_file at
# the tree root, .env) out of the build context. Exact names, never .env* —
# .env.example must ship. This Dockerfile-adjacent form is honored only under
# BuildKit (the Dockerfile's # syntax line forces it); this tree also ships a
# context-root .dockerignore backstop for legacy builders.
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/dist
**/.env
**/.dev.vars
.git
